{
  "name": "workspace-checkpoint-list-renders-header-and-members",
  "description": "GET /workspace/checkpoints after one create: the header with its owner (the creating session's controller id), the #191 `receiver` and `registered_by` (both null: anyone may register, nobody has), and every member row with the honesty fields a consumer must see. `owner` is preserved verbatim so the row says WHO took it. `restore_status` is the string `none`, not null, and `restore_updated_at` is null until a status write. `created_at` and `created_at_tick` are both stamped from the clock at create time, so both are ignored.",
